# Local planning/design docs — never published to this public repo
docs/superpowers/

# Experiment output — the record of an actual run against a real warehouse.
# It is one account's timings, credits, and warehouse names, so it is local
# data rather than repo content. The CLIs write into whatever directory they
# are run from, so these patterns stay unanchored on purpose. An experiment
# that writes results names them `<experiment>-run-<token>.<ext>` or puts them
# under `runs/`, so new experiments land here without touching this file.
*-run-*.json
*-run-*.csv
*-run-*.txt
runs/
